  "display_title": "Can't Buy Me Love",
  "description": "Donghwa’s turning 25 years old. An occasion to celebrate, right? Well, it would be if he wasn’t all by himself at a bar, drinking his sorrows away. The guy he’s actually got a crush on, his roommate, is at work. Plus, his roommate doesn’t swing that way anyways, Donghwa’s just foolishly holding out hope that someday he’ll come around. Down on his luck in love and in his work, nothing seems to be going his way. But when an expensive-looking man, with the kindest eyes, approaches him at the bar, Donghwa's heart starts to flutter. Will this man be the solution to all his problems, or will his life get even more complicated…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
